# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# PVL-062/PVL-075: an icon frame paints what changed and nothing else --
# selecting one icon repaints that icon, not the window of them.
wait 8
key 1 ctrl
wait 10
note the mode switch behind us, a quiet stretch paints no pose at all
draw-reset
wait 20
expect-drawn 0
note a press darkens the icon under it, one pose painted; the release
note then paints it selected, one pose again -- where it is, nothing else
press 88 119
wait 6
draw-reset
release 88 119
wait 6
expect-drawn 2
expect-drawn at-least 1
note clearing the selection paints it once more, still alone
draw-reset
click 150 119
wait 6
expect-drawn 2
expect-drawn at-least 1
note and the frame as a whole matches what a full redraw would say
expect-same-as-redraw
quit
